# Server-side secrets for the Pages Function when running `wrangler pages dev`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored). In production set the same names with:
#   wrangler pages secret put OPENAI_API_KEY --project-name nobiliare-translator
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
